OL,3,AMan who stole ambulance with patient
OL,4,Ainside jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug addict who stole an ambulance
OL,7,Fwith an elderly patient and paramedic
OL,8,Finside has been jailed for 21 months.
OL,10,FMarshall Leese, a prolific user of
OL,11,Fmonkey dust, was chased by police for
OL,12,Ftwo miles after taking the ambulance
OL,13,Ffrom outside the Royal Stoke University
OL,14,FHospital in Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,16,FHe stopped at a petrol station on the
OL,17,FA34 in Newcastle-under-Lyme and fled
OL,18,Fthe vehicle but was found hiding nearby
OL,19,Fby a police sniffer dog.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
